OL,3,GNEWSACouncil claims asylum centre could
OL,4,Acost it #29m
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorfolk County Council has formally
OL,7,Fobjected to plans to use RAF Barnham as
OL,8,Fan asylum processing centre, claiming
OL,9,Fit could cost the authority as much as
OL,10,F#29.8m over the next 10 years.
OL,12,FIn a letter to the home secretary,
OL,13,Fcouncil leader David Bick said: "Please
OL,14,Fdo listen and take our concerns
OL,15,Fseriously. We are listening to what the
OL,16,Flocal communities are telling us, and
OL,17,Fyou should too."
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
