OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil claims asylum centre could
OL,4,Acost it #29m
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough the former military base is in
OL,7,FSuffolk, it is close to Thetford in
OL,8,FNorfolk and the Reform UK-run authority
OL,9,Fsays having an asylum centre there
OL,10,Fwould put a strain on local services.
OL,12,FA government spokesman said it was
OL,13,Fworking on a fairer distribution of
OL,14,Fasylum accommodation across the
OL,15,Fcountry.
